  "task": "We're experiencing extreme heat conditions in the downtown district. First, retrieve current heat island metrics and tree canopy coverage to identify priority intervention zones. Then, create work orders for urgent green space maintenance in critical areas and purchase carbon offsets for our municipal buildings. Finally, notify residents about cooling centers and issue emergency heat alerts for the most affected neighborhoods."
